---@field lowerCappingSettings? growthbook.CreateBulkImportFactRequestFactMetricsItemDataLowerCappingSettings|distilled.Null Independent lower cap. Omit on update to preserve it. Use null or type: none to disable it explicitly. Invalid values are rejected. For mixed cap types, the absolute bound takes precedence if thresholds cross.
