---@field priorSettings? growthbook.CreateBulkImportFactRequestFactMetricsItemDataPriorSettings Controls the bayesian prior for the metric. If omitted, organization defaults will be used.
---@field regressionAdjustmentSettings? growthbook.CreateBulkImportFactRequestFactMetricsItemDataRegressionAdjustmentSettings Controls the regression adjustment (CUPED) settings for the metric
