---@field shareLevel growthbook.CreateDashboardV2RequestShareLevel|string General Dashboards only. Dashboards that are "published" are viewable by organization members with appropriate permissions
---@field enableAutoUpdates boolean If enabled for a General Dashboard, also requires an updateSchedule
