---@field metricOverrides? growthbook.CreateExperimentRequestMetricOverridesList Per-metric analysis overrides for this experiment. Replaces the entire stored array (does not patch individual entries).
---@field defaultDashboardId? string ID of the default dashboard for this experiment.
