---@class growthbook.CreateReportRequest
---@field experimentId string The experiment to create a report for
---@field title? string Report title (defaults to experiment name)
---@field description? string Report description
---@field owner? string The userId or email address of the owner. If an email address is provided, it will be used to look up the userId of the matching organization member. If an ID is provided, it will be validated as existing in the organization. When omitted, it defaults to the requesting member: a personal access token's owner, or the member an organization API key assumes. An organization API key acting as itself leaves it empty.
---@field statsEngine? growthbook.CreateReportRequestStatsEngine|string Stats engine override
---@field goalMetrics? growthbook.CreateReportRequestGoalMetricsList Goal metric IDs (defaults to experiment's goal metrics)
---@field secondaryMetrics? growthbook.CreateReportRequestSecondaryMetricsList Secondary metric IDs (defaults to experiment's secondary metrics)
---@field guardrailMetrics? growthbook.CreateReportRequestGuardrailMetricsList Guardrail metric IDs (defaults to experiment's guardrail metrics)
---@field activationMetric? string Activation metric ID
---@field dimension? string Dimension to cut results by
---@field dateStarted? string Analysis start date (ISO 8601)
---@field dateEnded? string Analysis end date (ISO 8601)
---@field regressionAdjustmentEnabled? boolean Enable CUPED regression adjustment
---@field sequentialTestingEnabled? boolean Enable sequential testing
---@field sequentialTestingTuningParameter? number Tuning parameter for sequential testing (frequentist only)
---@field differenceType? growthbook.CreateReportRequestDifferenceType|string How lifts are expressed in results. Defaults to experiment setting.
---@field attributionModel? growthbook.CreateReportRequestAttributionModel|string Metric conversion window attribution model. Defaults to experiment setting.
---@field lookbackOverride? growthbook.CreateReportRequestLookbackOverride Lookback window when `attributionModel` is `lookbackOverride`
---@field metricOverrides? growthbook.CreateReportRequestMetricOverridesList Per-metric window, prior, and regression-adjustment overrides
---@field customMetricSlices? growthbook.CreateReportRequestCustomMetricSlicesList Custom metric slice definitions
---@field segment? string Segment ID to filter users by. Defaults to experiment setting.
---@field queryFilter? string Raw SQL WHERE clause added to the exposure query. Defaults to experiment setting.
---@field skipPartialData? boolean When true, exclude users who have not completed the full conversion window.
---@field shareLevel? growthbook.CreateReportRequestShareLevel|string Visibility of the created report. Defaults to `private`. Set to `public` to receive a shareable `shareUrl` in the response.

