---@field stopAt? string ISO datetime when the experiment should stop. Resolved from `stopAfter` at start when a relative end was set.
---@field stopAfter? growthbook.ExperimentStatusUpdateScheduleStopAfter Relative end offset. Deferred: resolved to a concrete `stopAt` at the experiment's actual start (or off `dateStarted` when already running).
---@field scheduledStopPlan? growthbook.ScheduledStopPlan End-of-experiment automation applied at the scheduled end. Required whenever a `stopAt` or `stopAfter` is set (any mode, including `notify`).

