---Replaces all feature rules atomically. Behavior differs from v1: v1 PUT applies per-environment patches, v2 PUT swaps the entire `rules` array in one revision. To preserve existing rules during a partial edit, GET the feature first, mutate the returned `rules` array, and PUT the full array back. Safe-rollout rules round-trip via their `safeRolloutId` (creation requires `POST /v2/features/:id/revisions/:version/rules`).
---@alias growthbook.UpdateFeatureV2RequestRulesList growthbook.UpdateFeatureV2RequestRulesItem[]

---Deprecated — pass `skipSchemaValidation` in the request body instead.
---@alias growthbook.UpdateFeatureV2RequestSkipSchemaValidation string|boolean

---Tags for filtering and grouping. Use these instead of encoding groups in names. Replaces the existing tags completely.
---@alias growthbook.UpdateFeatureV2RequestTagsList string[]

---Secondary project IDs this feature is targeted in and served to, beyond its primary `project`. Adding a project requires the `targetFeatures` permission (FlagsTarget policy) in that project. Governance stays with `project`.
---@alias growthbook.UpdateFeatureV2RequestTargetingProjectsList string[]

