---@class growthbook.UpdateHoldoutRequest
---@field id string
---@field name? string Short display name. Put details in `description`.
---@field description? string Markdown. Put context here, not in the name.
---@field projects? growthbook.UpdateHoldoutRequestProjectsList Project IDs this Holdout applies to. Send an empty array for All Projects.
---@field owner? string The userId or email address of the owner. If an email address is provided, it will be used to look up the userId of the matching organization member. If an ID is provided, it will be validated as existing in the organization.
---@field tags? growthbook.UpdateHoldoutRequestTagsList Tags for filtering and grouping. Use these instead of encoding groups in names.
---@field archived? boolean
---@field skipAsDefaultHoldout? boolean When true, this Holdout is not selected automatically when creating Feature Flags or Experiments in Projects assigned to the Holdout.
---@field holdoutSize? number Proportion of traffic placed in the holdout group (e.g. 0.05 for 5%). An equally sized comparison group is sampled from the remaining traffic for measurement, so 2× this value enters the holdout experiment in total. Must be greater than 0 and at most 0.5.
---@field hashAttribute? string
---@field targetingCondition? string
---@field savedGroupTargeting? growthbook.UpdateHoldoutRequestSavedGroupTargetingList
---@field datasourceId? string
---@field assignmentQuery? growthbook.UpdateHoldoutRequestAssignmentQuery The assignment query, grouping its ID with the identifier type analyzed on. Mutually exclusive with the deprecated `assignmentQueryId`.
---@field assignmentQueryId? string Deprecated: use `assignmentQuery`. Rejected when selecting a different assignment query that declares several identifier types; set `assignmentQuery.identifierType` instead.
---@field goalMetrics? growthbook.UpdateHoldoutRequestGoalMetricsList
---@field secondaryMetrics? growthbook.UpdateHoldoutRequestSecondaryMetricsList
---@field statsEngine? growthbook.UpdateHoldoutRequestStatsEngine|string Statistics engine used to analyze this Holdout.
---@field environments? growthbook.UpdateHoldoutRequestEnvironmentsMap Replaces the entire per-environment state. Environments not listed are disabled.
---@field statusUpdateSchedule? growthbook.UpdateHoldoutRequestStatusUpdateSchedule|distilled.Null

---The assignment query, grouping its ID with the identifier type analyzed on. Mutually exclusive with the deprecated `assignmentQueryId`.
---@class growthbook.UpdateHoldoutRequestAssignmentQuery
---@field id string The ID of one of the data source's assignment queries.
---@field identifierType? string|distilled.Null The identifier type to analyze on, which the query must declare. Required when selecting a different assignment query that declares several. Otherwise defaults to the current identifier type, or the query's only one. Null is treated as omitted, so a response's value can be sent back.

---Replaces the entire per-environment state. Environments not listed are disabled.
---@alias growthbook.UpdateHoldoutRequestEnvironmentsMap { [string]: growthbook.UpdateHoldoutRequestEnvironmentsValue }

---@class growthbook.UpdateHoldoutRequestEnvironmentsValue
