---Statistics engine used to analyze this Holdout.
---@alias growthbook.UpdateHoldoutRequestStatsEngine "bayesian"|"frequentist"

---Automatic stage transitions for the Holdout. Dates must be consecutive: `startAt` before `startAnalysisPeriodAt` before `stopAt`. Send `null` to delete the schedule.
---@class growthbook.UpdateHoldoutRequestStatusUpdateSchedule
---@field startAt? string ISO datetime to move the Holdout from `draft` to `running`. Must be in the future while the Holdout is still a draft.
---@field startAnalysisPeriodAt? string ISO datetime to move the Holdout from `running` to `analysis-period`. Requires `startAt` while the Holdout is still a draft.
---@field stopAt? string ISO datetime to stop the Holdout. Requires `startAnalysisPeriodAt` unless the analysis period has already begun.

