---@param input growthbook.DeleteFeatureRevisionRuleRampScheduleV2Request
---@return growthbook.DeleteFeatureRevisionRuleRampScheduleV2Response? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:delete_feature_revision_rule_ramp_schedule_v2(input) end

