---
---`PUT /v2/features/{id}/revisions/{version}/log/{logId}`
---@param input growthbook.PutFeatureRevisionLogCommentV2Request
---@return growthbook.PutFeatureRevisionLogCommentV2Response? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:put_feature_revision_log_comment_v2(input) end

