---`PUT /v1/ramp-schedule-templates/{id}`
---@param input growthbook.UpdateRampScheduleTemplateRequest
---@return growthbook.UpdateRampScheduleTemplateResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:update_ramp_schedule_template(input) end

